        "content": "# LGOS graph observability\n\n**Health → trends → trace.** Metrics cover LGOS chat-completion attempts and graph execution. The trace table shows complete UI → Traefik → Bifrost → LGOS → LangGraph flows. Select a **Trace ID** to open the Grafana waterfall or the matching Langfuse trace.",
